[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0010","text":"不、不行啊……！\n墙壁，要是弄坏的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0020","text":"那，走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0030","text":"对面"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0040","text":"咿…………对、对面是……？\n────等、等一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0050","text":"最近，到底怎么了呢\n制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0060","text":"虽然听说会议拖得很长……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0080","text":"希望他没有勉强自己啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0090","text":"────吓死我了～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0100","text":"怎、怎么了……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0110","text":"来事务所的路上，不是有栋好大的房子吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0120","text":"栅栏里面有只可爱的小狗，我就跟它搭话\n结果被超大声地吼了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0130","text":"啊……\n那只狗，经常隔着栅栏看这边呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0140","text":"它好像一直想出来呢\n那边的狗狗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0150","text":"想出来就出来嘛，\n温柔地跟我说一声就好～～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0152","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0160","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0170","text":"…………哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0180","text":"…………不行啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0190","text":"……我在画什么呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0200","text":"────\n透、透酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0210","text":"啊，那边，大概……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0220","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0230","text":"透、透酱……！\n等等……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0240","text":"真的渴望飞翔于这片天空吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0250","text":"…………小皮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0260","text":"不去……外面……吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0270","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0280","text":"…………完全不行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0290","text":"…………不够啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0300","text":"不对，不是这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0310","text":"……这样根本………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0320","text":"我知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0330","text":"让这块画布变得狭窄的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0331","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0340","text":"……好、好漂亮啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0350","text":"透、透……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0360","text":"啊——\n嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0361","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0370","text":"也许不对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0380","text":"……诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0390","text":"回去吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0400","text":"让那些孩子们飞翔的天空\n变得狭窄的────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0401","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0410","text":"啊——————————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0419","text":"阳希＆制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_05_0420","text":"我／是我"}]
